//   Donnelly-Li N-Broker (2025), Cartea-Jaimungal-SB Nash FBSDE (2025),
//   Ahmadi-Tahmasebi Hawkes Malliavin Delta (2025),
//   Bergault-Cardaliaguet-Yan MFG Broker (2025),
//   Barzykin-Boyce-Neuman Toxic Flow Partial Info (2024),
//   Rosenmann-Ventura Dependence Closure Portfolio (2023),
//   Kuhn et al. Wasserstein DRO (2024),
//   Andersen et al. HF Option Microstructure (2019/FoFI 2020),
//   Stamatopoulos-Zeng QSP Derivative Pricing (2024),
//   Wu-Jaimungal Robust RDEU Hedging (2023),
