//   B6     Utter (FULLTEXT01-0dFlF, 2026): XGBoost/MLP ML mean-reversion filter
//   B7/B18 Vilkov (ssrn-4641356, 2026): 0DTE conditional rules (10:00 ET OOS), basket diversification
